# Lipase and oil: hydrolysing a triglyceride mixture
#
# Equal oil-and-water samples compare lipase, no enzyme, and protease.
register lv1

add v1 water 50mL
add v1 vegetable_oil 10g
add v1 lipase 0.1g

new beaker
add v2 water 50mL
add v2 vegetable_oil 10g

new beaker
add v3 water 50mL
add v3 vegetable_oil 10g
add v3 protease 0.1g

wait 1h
look v1
look v2
look v3

# The oil remains a conserved unresolved mixture. The bench does not invent
# a pH fall or named glycerol and fatty-acid amounts it cannot yet ledger.
